description	"Richter Belmont

^2Weapons:
- Holy Water (15)
- Vampire Killer Whip 

^5Powers:
- Jump  (3)
- Speed (3)

^8Attributes:
- Force Block (1)
- Cortosis (1)
- Heal (3)
- Rally

The Belmont Clan is bound by their bloodline to kill Dracula whenever he arises. Richter Belmont must carry on with his family's oath. Armed with the legendary Vampire Killer whip given to him by his ancestors, Richter rides forth to meet his eternal enemy."